    "market_commentary": "After three consecutive weekly declines, the SSY Pacific Capesize Index returned to growth, rising by 1,456 points to 11,624. There was a $2.25/t jump in the W.Australia-China iron ore spot voyage rate to $16.40/t, while the round-voyage rate rose by $11,000/day to $53,000/day.",
